<template><main class="expert-workspace"><header class="expert-hero"><div><span class="expert-eyebrow">PRODUCTO · ASISTENCIA TÉCNICA</span><h1>Técnico experto</h1><p>Diagnósticos documentados, compatibilidad e informes para tus clientes.</p><small v-if="settings">{{settings.user}} · {{caseCode || 'Caso nuevo'}} <span v-if="dirty">· Cambios pendientes</span></small></div><div class="expert-actions"><button type="button" @click="newCase" :disabled="busy">＋ Nuevo caso</button><button type="button" class="expert-primary" @click="saveCase" :disabled="busy || !settings">Guardar caso</button></div></header><nav class="expert-tabs" aria-label="Áreas de Técnico experto"><button v-for="item in tabs" :key="item.key" type="button" :class="{active:tab===item.key}" @click="tab=item.key">{{item.label}}</button></nav><p v-if="error" class="expert-error" role="alert">{{error}}</p><p v-if="success" class="expert-success" role="status">{{success}}</p><p v-if="busy" class="expert-progress" role="status">{{status}}</p><section v-show="tab==='diagnosis'" class="expert-grid"><div class="expert-card"><h2>DIAGNÓSTICO DE CUALQUIER EQUIPO</h2><tecnico-buscador-experto :active="tab==='diagnosis'" @dictation-start="stopDictation" :settings="settings" @use="useExpertDevice"/><section class="expert-autofill"><strong>Autocompletar servicio técnico</strong><div class="expert-fields"><label>Especialidad<select v-model="serviceFamily" @change="serviceIssue=serviceOptions[0]"><option value="pc">Computadoras</option><option value="laptop">Laptops</option><option value="cctv">Cámaras de seguridad</option></select></label><label>Consulta habitual<select v-model="serviceIssue"><option v-for="option in serviceOptions" :key="option" :value="option">{{option}}</option></select></label></div><button type="button" @click="applyServiceTemplate" :disabled="busy">Autocompletar caso</button><small>Completa solo los campos vacíos. Los síntomas, pruebas y mediciones deben ser registrados por el técnico.</small></section><div class="expert-fields"><label>Asunto<input v-model="draft.title" maxlength="250" placeholder="Evaluación de equipo o compatibilidad"></label><label>Cliente o entidad<input v-model="draft.client" maxlength="250" placeholder="Cliente o institución"></label><label>Equipo / producto<input v-model="draft.equipment" maxlength="500" list="expert-equipment-suggestions" @input="suggestEquipment($event.target.value)" @change="useEquipmentSuggestion" placeholder="Laptop, servidor, cámara, accesorio…"></label><datalist id="expert-equipment-suggestions"><option v-for="product in equipmentSuggestions" :key="product.IdProducto" :value="product.Producto">{{product.ProductoModelo}}</option></datalist><label>Modelo exacto<input v-model="draft.model" maxlength="200" placeholder="Modelo o número de parte"></label><label>Serie o inventario<input v-model="draft.serial" maxlength="200"></label><label>Tipo de evaluación<select v-model="draft.mode"><option value="diagnostico">Diagnóstico</option><option value="compatibilidad">Compatibilidad</option><option value="comparativa">Comparativa</option></select></label></div><label>Solicitud del cliente<div class="expert-field-heading"><small>¿Qué necesita conocer o solucionar?</small><button type="button" class="expert-voice" :disabled="!voiceSupported || busy" @click="dictate('request')">{{dictating==='request'?'■ Detener':'🎙 Dictar'}}</button></div><textarea v-model="draft.request" rows="4" maxlength="6000" placeholder="Describe la consulta y el resultado que espera el cliente."></textarea></label><label>Narrativa y observaciones del técnico<div class="expert-field-heading"><small>Registra síntomas, antecedentes y evidencias reales.</small><button type="button" class="expert-voice" :disabled="!voiceSupported || busy" @click="dictate('narrative')">{{dictating==='narrative'?'■ Detener':'🎙 Dictar'}}</button></div><textarea v-model="draft.narrative" rows="6" maxlength="12000" placeholder="El cliente reporta… Durante la revisión se observó…"></textarea></label><label>Pruebas realizadas y resultados<div class="expert-field-heading"><small>Solo pruebas efectivamente realizadas.</small><button type="button" class="expert-voice" :disabled="!voiceSupported || busy" @click="dictate('tests')">{{dictating==='tests'?'■ Detener':'🎙 Dictar'}}</button></div><textarea v-model="draft.tests" rows="4" maxlength="8000" placeholder="Prueba, medición, fecha y resultado, si los conoces."></textarea></label><label>Otros equipos o componentes a comparar<textarea v-model="draft.comparison" rows="3" maxlength="6000" placeholder="Indica modelos, capacidades, interfaces y dudas de compatibilidad."></textarea></label><p v-if="voiceMessage" class="expert-note" role="status">{{voiceMessage}}</p><p v-if="!voiceSupported" class="expert-note">Tu navegador no ofrece dictado por voz. Puedes escribir todos los campos.</p></div><aside class="expert-column"><section class="expert-card"><h2>EVIDENCIAS DEL DIAGNÓSTICO</h2><button type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="openValidatorQuotes">Buscar proformas y validar</button><p class="expert-note">Abre el historial de proformas y sus productos en el validador de compatibilidad.</p><p>Adjunta PDF, Word, texto o fotografías. Hasta 3 archivos, 4 MB por archivo y 8 MB en total.</p><input ref="attachments" type="file" multiple accept=".pdf,.docx,.txt,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.webp" :disabled="busy" @change="attach"><button type="button" class="expert-autofill-file" @click="autofillFromFiles" :disabled="busy || !canAnalyze || !files.length">Autocompletar desde adjuntos</button><ul class="expert-files"><li v-for="(file,i) in files" :key="file.name+i"><span>{{file.name}} <small>{{Math.round(file.size/1024)}} KB</small></span><button type="button" :disabled="busy" @click="removeFile(i)" :aria-label="'Quitar '+file.name">×</button></li></ul><p v-if="draft.attachments.length && !files.length" class="expert-note">Archivos citados en este caso: {{draft.attachments.map(f=>f.name).join(', ')}}. Adjunta nuevamente los documentos para un nuevo análisis.</p><small>Al analizar se envían a OpenAI la narrativa y los adjuntos seleccionados. Los archivos no se publican ni se guardan en una carpeta pública.</small></section><section class="expert-card expert-run"><h2>Evaluar la información</h2><p>La IA propone fundamentos, verificaciones y un borrador de informe. El técnico revisa y corrige las conclusiones.</p><button type="button" class="expert-primary" @click="analyze" :disabled="busy || !canAnalyze || !(draft.request.trim() || draft.narrative.trim())">Analizar y preparar informe</button><small v-if="!canAnalyze">Activa OpenAI en ALI para analizar. El informe manual y el guardado siguen disponibles.</small></section><section v-if="draft.analysis" class="expert-card"><h2>Respuesta técnica</h2><p class="expert-output">{{draft.analysis}}</p><details v-if="draft.sources.length"><summary>Fuentes consultadas</summary><ul><li v-for="source in draft.sources" :key="source.url"><a :href="source.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{source.title || source.url}}</a></li></ul></details><button type="button" @click="tab='report'">Revisar informe técnico →</button></section></aside></section><tecnico-validador ref="validator" v-show="tab==='validator'" v-model="draft.validator" :settings="settings" @investigate="investigateProduct"/><section v-show="tab==='images'" class="expert-card"><h2>Buscar producto e imágenes</h2><p>Busca por nombre y modelo. Vincula un producto del catálogo para abrir su ficha y guardar imágenes en sus tres espacios.</p><div class="expert-fields"><label>Nombre del producto<input v-model="imageQuery" maxlength="300" placeholder="Ej. laptop HP o cámara Dahua"></label><label>Modelo<input v-model="imageModel" maxlength="200" placeholder="Modelo exacto"></label></div><div class="expert-actions"><button type="button" @click="searchCatalog" :disabled="busy || imageQuery.trim().length<2">🔍 Buscar en catálogo</button><button type="button" class="expert-primary" @click="searchImages" :disabled="busy || !imageQuery.trim() || !imageModel.trim()">Buscar imágenes y detalles</button><a :href="externalImages" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Búsqueda de imágenes ↗</a></div><ul v-if="products.length" class="expert-product-list"><li v-for="product in products" :key="product.IdProducto"><div><strong>{{product.Producto}}</strong><small>{{product.ProductoModelo || 'Modelo sin registrar'}}</small></div><button type="button" @click="selectProduct(product)">Usar producto</button></li></ul><div v-if="selectedProduct" class="expert-selected-product"><strong>Vinculado: {{selectedProduct.Producto}}</strong><button type="button" @click="openProduct()">Abrir ficha e imágenes</button></div><p v-if="imageText" class="expert-output">{{imageText}}</p><div v-if="imageResults.length" class="expert-image-grid"><article v-for="image in imageResults" :key="image.url"><img :src="image.url" :alt="image.title" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" loading="lazy"><a :href="image.source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{image.title || 'Fuente'}}</a><button type="button" :disabled="!selectedProduct" @click="openProduct(image.url)">Guardar en producto vinculado</button></article></div><p v-if="imageSearched && !imageResults.length" class="expert-note">No se encontraron imágenes descargables del modelo. Usa la búsqueda externa y pega el enlace en la ficha de imágenes del producto.</p></section><section v-show="tab==='manuals'" class="expert-card"><h2>Buscador opcional de manuales técnicos</h2><p>Manuales de servicio, instalación y usuario para computadoras, laptops, cámaras y grabadores. Prioriza el modelo exacto y el fabricante.</p><div class="expert-fields"><label>Equipo, marca o nombre<input v-model="manualQuery" maxlength="300" placeholder="Ej. HP laptop, placa ASUS o cámara Dahua"></label><label>Modelo para el manual<input v-model="manualModel" maxlength="200" placeholder="Modelo o número de parte"></label></div><div class="expert-actions"><button type="button" @click="useCaseForManual">Usar equipo del caso</button><button type="button" class="expert-primary" @click="searchManuals" :disabled="busy || !manualQuery.trim()">Buscar manual técnico</button><a :href="externalManuals" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Búsqueda externa de manuales ↗</a></div><p v-if="manualText" class="expert-output">{{manualText}}</p><ul class="expert-manual-results"><li v-for="source in manualSources" :key="source.url"><a :href="source.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{source.title || source.url}}</a></li></ul><button v-if="manualSources.length" type="button" @click="includeManualSources">Añadir estas fuentes al caso</button><p class="expert-note">Verifica que el manual corresponda al modelo y variante del equipo antes de aplicar sus indicaciones.</p></section><section v-show="tab==='report'" class="expert-card expert-report"><div class="expert-report-heading"><div><h2>Informe técnico editable</h2><p>Dirigido a clientes, jefaturas o entidades. Puedes redactarlo manualmente o revisar el borrador generado.</p></div><button type="button" class="expert-primary" @click="downloadWord" :disabled="busy || !draft.reviewed || !draft.report.diagnosis.trim() || !draft.report.conclusion.trim()">Descargar Word .docx</button></div><div class="expert-fields"><label>Destinatario / jefatura / entidad<input v-model="draft.recipient" maxlength="300" placeholder="A quién se dirige el informe"></label><label>Técnico responsable<input v-model="draft.technician" maxlength="200"></label></div><div v-for="(label,key) in reportFields" :key="key" class="expert-report-section"><div class="expert-field-heading"><label :for="'report-'+key">{{label}}</label><button type="button" class="expert-voice" :disabled="!voiceSupported || busy" @click="dictate('report.'+key)">{{dictating==='report.'+key?'■ Detener':'🎙 Dictar'}}</button></div><textarea :id="'report-'+key" v-model="draft.report[key]" rows="4" maxlength="16000"></textarea></div><label class="expert-review"><input type="checkbox" v-model="draft.reviewed"> He revisado el informe, sus evidencias y conclusiones antes de entregarlo.</label><div class="expert-actions"><button type="button" @click="saveCase" :disabled="busy">Guardar caso e informe</button><button type="button" class="expert-primary" @click="downloadWord" :disabled="busy || !draft.reviewed || !draft.report.diagnosis.trim() || !draft.report.conclusion.trim()">Descargar Word .docx</button></div></section><section v-show="tab==='history'" class="expert-card"><div class="expert-field-heading"><h2>Casos e informes guardados</h2><button type="button" @click="loadHistory" :disabled="busy">Actualizar historial</button></div><input v-model="historySearch" placeholder="Buscar asunto, cliente o técnico"><p v-if="!filteredHistory.length">No hay casos que coincidan.</p><ul class="expert-history"><li v-for="item in filteredHistory" :key="item.id"><div><strong>TEC-{{String(item.id).padStart(6,'0')}} · {{item.title}}</strong><p>{{item.client || 'Cliente sin indicar'}} · {{item.owner}} · {{item.status}}</p><small>{{item.updated_at}} · Revisión {{item.revision}}</small></div><button type="button" @click="loadCase(item.id)" :disabled="busy">Abrir caso</button></li></ul></section></main></template>
<script>
import TecnicoValidador from '@/components/TecnicoValidador.vue'
import TecnicoBuscadorExperto from '@/components/TecnicoBuscadorExperto.vue'

const fields={summary:'Resumen ejecutivo',background:'Antecedentes y solicitud',equipment:'Equipos evaluados',findings:'Hallazgos observados',tests:'Pruebas realizadas',diagnosis:'Diagnóstico técnico',recommendations:'Recomendaciones',limitations:'Limitaciones y verificaciones pendientes',conclusion:'Conclusiones'};
const freshValidator=()=>({assembly:true,equipment:'',model:'',request:'',comparison:'',quoteProducts:[],compatibility:[],analysis:'',sources:[]});
const fresh=()=>({validator:freshValidator(),title:'',client:'',recipient:'',technician:'',equipment:'',model:'',serial:'',mode:'diagnostico',request:'',narrative:'',tests:'',comparison:'',quoteProducts:[],compatibility:[],assembly:true,analysis:'',sources:[],attachments:[],reviewed:false,report:Object.keys(fields).reduce((o,k)=>{o[k]='';return o},{})});
export default {components:{TecnicoValidador,TecnicoBuscadorExperto},data(){return {tabs:[{key:'diagnosis',label:'DIAGNÓSTICO EXPERTO'},{key:'validator',label:'Validador de compatibilidad'},{key:'images',label:'Productos e imágenes'},{key:'manuals',label:'Manuales técnicos'},{key:'report',label:'Informe técnico'},{key:'history',label:'Historial'}],tab:'diagnosis',settings:null,draft:fresh(),reportFields:fields,id:0,revision:0,caseCode:'',files:[],history:[],historySearch:'',busy:false,status:'',error:'',success:'',baseline:'',voiceSupported:!!(window.SpeechRecognition||window.webkitSpeechRecognition),dictating:'',voiceMessage:'',imageQuery:'',imageModel:'',imageText:'',imageResults:[],imageSearched:false,products:[],selectedProduct:null,serviceFamily:'laptop',serviceIssue:'Diagnóstico general',equipmentSuggestions:[],manualQuery:'',manualModel:'',manualText:'',manualSources:[]}},computed:{serviceOptions(){return {pc:['Diagnóstico general','No enciende','Lentitud o reinicios','Ampliación de RAM o almacenamiento','Mantenimiento preventivo'],laptop:['Diagnóstico general','No enciende o no carga','Pantalla, teclado o batería','Ampliación de RAM o SSD','Mantenimiento o sobrecalentamiento'],cctv:['Diagnóstico general','Sin imagen o desconexiones','Instalación y configuración','Compatibilidad con DVR o NVR','Grabación y almacenamiento'],other:['Diagnostico general','Falla de funcionamiento','Configuracion o conexion','Mantenimiento']}[this.serviceFamily]},externalManuals(){return 'https://www.google.com/search?q='+encodeURIComponent([this.manualQuery,this.manualModel,'manual técnico fabricante filetype:pdf'].filter(Boolean).join(' '))},canAnalyze(){return this.settings&&this.settings.enabled&&this.settings.configured},dirty(){return this.baseline!==JSON.stringify(this.draft)},filteredHistory(){const query=this.historySearch.toLowerCase();return this.history.filter(row=>[row.title,row.client,row.owner].join(' ').toLowerCase().includes(query))},externalImages(){return 'https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q='+encodeURIComponent(this.imageQuery+' '+this.imageModel)}},watch:{'draft.report':{deep:true,handler(){if(!this.applying)this.draft.reviewed=false}},tab(value){if(value==='history')this.loadHistory()}},async mounted(){this.beforeExit=e=>{if(this.dirty){e.preventDefault();e.returnValue=''}};window.addEventListener('beforeunload',this.beforeExit);try{const response=await fetch('/api/index.php/ali/config',{credentials:'same-origin'});const data=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw Error(data.error||'No se pudo verificar la sesión.');this.settings=data;this.draft.technician=data.user;this.baseline=JSON.stringify(this.draft)}catch(e){this.error=e.message}},beforeDestroy(){clearTimeout(this.suggestTimer);if(this.suggestController)this.suggestController.abort();this.stopDictation();if(this.controller)this.controller.abort();window.removeEventListener('beforeunload',this.beforeExit)},methods:{openValidatorQuotes(){this.tab='validator';this.$nextTick(()=>this.$refs.validator.openQuotes())},useExpertDevice(device){if((this.draft.equipment||this.draft.request)&&!window.confirm('Reemplazar el equipo y la solicitud del diagnostico con esta consulta?'))return;this.draft.equipment=device.equipment;this.draft.model=device.model;this.draft.request=device.request;this.draft.mode='diagnostico';this.draft.analysis='';this.draft.report=Object.keys(fields).reduce((o,k)=>{o[k]='';return o},{});this.success='Equipo y consulta copiados al diagnostico.'},investigateProduct(product){this.imageQuery=product.name;this.imageModel=product.model;this.tab='images'},importQuote(result){this.draft.comparison=result.text;this.draft.quoteProducts=result.products.slice(0,25).map((p,i)=>({key:String(i),name:p.Producto||'',model:p.ProductoModelo||'',specs:String(p.Descripcion||p.ProductoDesc||'').slice(0,2000)}));this.draft.compatibility=[];this.draft.assembly=true;this.draft.mode='compatibilidad';if(!this.draft.client)this.draft.client=result.quote.Cliente||'';if(!this.draft.request)this.draft.request='Evaluar la compatibilidad individual de cada producto de la proforma con el equipo del caso y entre componentes relacionados. Para cada uno indicar compatible, incompatible o pendiente de verificar, con fundamento, requisitos y fuentes. Todas las piezas de esta proforma forman una sola computadora por ensamblar; comparar entre si e identificar bloqueos y sustituciones.';this.success='Piezas cargadas para ensamblar una computadora. Pulsa Evaluar ensamblaje para revisar los conflictos entre ellas.'},applyServiceTemplate(){const names={pc:'Computadora de escritorio',laptop:'Laptop',cctv:'Cámara de seguridad / DVR / NVR'};const type=names[this.serviceFamily]||'Equipo';if(!this.draft.title.trim())this.draft.title=this.serviceIssue+' de '+type.toLowerCase();if(!this.draft.equipment.trim())this.draft.equipment=type;if(!this.draft.request.trim())this.draft.request='Evaluar '+this.serviceIssue.toLowerCase()+' en '+type.toLowerCase()+', identificar los requisitos técnicos y las verificaciones necesarias según el modelo exacto. No confirmar fallas sin evidencias o pruebas.';this.success='Plantilla aplicada a los campos vacíos. Registra los síntomas y pruebas reales del equipo.'},autofillFromFiles(){this.run('Leyendo la proforma o evidencias para completar los datos disponibles…',async()=>{const result=await this.api({action:'autofill',data:this.draft,files:this.files.map(f=>({name:f.name,data:f.data}))});let count=0;Object.keys(result.fields||{}).forEach(key=>{if(typeof this.draft[key]==='string'&&!this.draft[key].trim()&&typeof result.fields[key]==='string'&&result.fields[key].trim()){this.draft[key]=result.fields[key];count++}});this.success=count?'Se completaron '+count+' campos vacíos. Revisa los datos extraídos del documento.':'No se reemplazaron campos escritos. El documento no aportó nuevos datos verificables.'})},suggestEquipment(query){clearTimeout(this.suggestTimer);if(!this.settings||this.busy||query.trim().length<2){this.equipmentSuggestions=[];return;}this.suggestTimer=setTimeout(async()=>{if(this.suggestController)this.suggestController.abort();const controller=new AbortController;this.suggestController=controller;try{const response=await fetch('/api/index.php/ali/tecnico',{method:'POST',credentials:'same-origin',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','X-Ali-CSRF':this.settings.csrf},body:JSON.stringify({action:'product_search',query:query.slice(0,200)}),signal:controller.signal});const data=await response.json();if(response.ok&&this.suggestController===controller)this.equipmentSuggestions=data.products||[]}catch(e){}},250)},useEquipmentSuggestion(){const product=this.equipmentSuggestions.find(p=>p.Producto===this.draft.equipment);if(product){if(!this.draft.model.trim())this.draft.model=product.ProductoModelo||'';this.selectedProduct=product}},useCaseForManual(){this.manualQuery=this.draft.equipment;this.manualModel=this.draft.model},searchManuals(){this.run('Buscando manuales y documentación oficial del equipo…',async()=>{const result=await this.api({action:'manuals',query:this.manualQuery,model:this.manualModel});this.manualText=result.text;this.manualSources=result.sources||[]})},includeManualSources(){const urls=new Set(this.draft.sources.map(s=>s.url));this.manualSources.forEach(source=>{if(!urls.has(source.url)){this.draft.sources.push(source);urls.add(source.url)}});this.success='Fuentes añadidas al caso para la revisión y el informe.'},async api(body,binary=false){if(this.controller)this.controller.abort();this.controller=new AbortController;const timer=setTimeout(()=>this.controller.abort(),160000);try{const response=await fetch('/api/index.php/ali/tecnico',{method:'POST',credentials:'same-origin',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','X-Ali-CSRF':this.settings?this.settings.csrf:''},body:JSON.stringify(body),signal:this.controller.signal});if(!response.ok){let data={};try{data=await response.json()}catch(e){}throw Error(data.error||'No se pudo completar la operación.')}return binary?await response.blob():await response.json()}finally{clearTimeout(timer)}},async run(status,operation){if(this.busy)return;this.stopDictation();this.busy=true;this.status=status;this.error='';this.success='';try{await operation()}catch(e){this.error=e.name==='AbortError'?'La operación tardó demasiado. Comprueba el historial antes de repetir un guardado.':e.message}finally{this.busy=false}},newCase(){if(this.dirty&&!window.confirm('Hay cambios sin guardar. ¿Crear un nuevo caso?'))return;this.stopDictation();this.draft=fresh();this.draft.technician=this.settings?this.settings.user:'';this.id=0;this.revision=0;this.caseCode='';this.files=[];this.baseline=JSON.stringify(this.draft);this.tab='diagnosis';this.error='';this.success=''},async attach(event){const chosen=Array.from(event.target.files||[]);event.target.value='';if(this.files.length+chosen.length>3){this.error='Adjunta como máximo tres archivos.';return;}let total=this.files.reduce((n,f)=>n+f.size,0);for(const file of chosen){const ext=(file.name.split('.').pop()||'').toLowerCase();if(!['pdf','docx','txt','jpg','jpeg','png','webp'].includes(ext)||file.size>4*1024*1024||(total+=file.size)>8*1024*1024){this.error='Usa PDF, DOCX, TXT o imágenes de hasta 4 MB; máximo 8 MB entre todos.';return;}}this.error='';try{for(const file of chosen){const data=await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const reader=new FileReader;reader.onload=()=>resolve(String(reader.result).split(',')[1]);reader.onerror=()=>reject(Error('No se pudo leer '+file.name));reader.readAsDataURL(file)});this.files.push({name:file.name,size:file.size,data})}this.draft.attachments=this.files.map(f=>({name:f.name}))}catch(e){this.error=e.message}},removeFile(index){this.files.splice(index,1);this.draft.attachments=this.files.map(f=>({name:f.name}))},analyze(){this.run('Analizando la narrativa, los adjuntos y las fuentes técnicas…',async()=>{const result=await this.api({action:'analyze',data:Object.assign({},this.draft,{mode:'diagnostico',quoteProducts:[],compatibility:[],comparison:'',validator:undefined}),files:this.files.map(f=>({name:f.name,data:f.data}))});this.applying=true;this.draft.analysis=result.analysis;this.draft.compatibility=result.compatibility||[];Object.keys(fields).forEach(key=>this.$set(this.draft.report,key,result.report[key]||''));this.draft.sources=result.sources||[];this.draft.reviewed=false;this.$nextTick(()=>{this.applying=false});this.success='Análisis preparado. Revisa los hallazgos y el borrador en Informe técnico.'})},saveCase(){this.run('Guardando caso e informe…',async()=>{const result=await this.api({action:'save',id:this.id,revision:this.revision,data:this.draft});this.id=result.id;this.revision=result.revision;this.caseCode=result.code;this.baseline=JSON.stringify(this.draft);this.success='Caso e informe guardados. Los archivos adjuntos no se conservan; queda registrado su nombre.'})},loadHistory(){this.run('Cargando historial…',async()=>{const result=await this.api({action:'list'});this.history=result.cases})},loadCase(id){if(this.dirty&&!window.confirm('Hay cambios sin guardar. ¿Abrir otro caso?'))return;this.run('Abriendo caso…',async()=>{const result=await this.api({action:'load',id});this.applying=true;this.draft=Object.assign(fresh(),result.data);if(!result.data.validator&&result.data.quoteProducts&&result.data.quoteProducts.length)this.draft.validator=Object.assign(freshValidator(),{quoteProducts:result.data.quoteProducts,compatibility:result.data.compatibility||[],assembly:result.data.assembly!==false,comparison:result.data.comparison||''});this.$nextTick(()=>{this.applying=false;this.baseline=JSON.stringify(this.draft)});this.id=Number(result.case.id);this.revision=Number(result.case.revision);this.caseCode='TEC-'+String(this.id).padStart(6,'0');this.files=[];this.tab='diagnosis';this.success='Caso abierto.'})},downloadWord(){this.run('Preparando el informe Word…',async()=>{const blob=await this.api({action:'export',data:this.draft},true);const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);const link=document.createElement('a');link.href=url;link.download='Informe-tecnico-'+(this.caseCode||'borrador')+'.docx';link.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),30000);this.success='Informe Word descargado. Puedes abrirlo y editarlo en Microsoft Word.'})},dictate(target){if(this.dictating===target){this.stopDictation();return;}this.stopDictation();const Recognition=window.SpeechRecognition||window.webkitSpeechRecognition;if(!Recognition)return;const recognition=new Recognition;this.recognition=recognition;recognition.lang='es-PE';recognition.continuous=true;recognition.interimResults=false;this.dictating=target;this.voiceMessage='Escuchando. Pulsa Detener al terminar.';recognition.onresult=event=>{let text='';for(let i=event.resultIndex;i<event.results.length;i++)if(event.results[i].isFinal)text+=event.results[i][0].transcript+' ';if(!text.trim())return;if(target.startsWith('report.')){const key=target.split('.')[1];this.$set(this.draft.report,key,(this.draft.report[key]+' '+text.trim()).trim().slice(0,16000))}else{const limits={request:6000,narrative:12000,tests:8000};this.draft[target]=(this.draft[target]+' '+text.trim()).trim().slice(0,limits[target]||6000)}};recognition.onerror=e=>{this.voiceMessage=e.error==='not-allowed'?'Permite el micrófono en tu navegador o escribe el texto.':'No se pudo continuar el dictado. Puedes volver a intentarlo.';this.dictating=''};recognition.onend=()=>{this.dictating=''};try{recognition.start()}catch(e){this.dictating='';this.voiceMessage='No se pudo iniciar el micrófono.'}},stopDictation(){if(this.recognition){this.recognition.onend=null;this.recognition.onresult=null;this.recognition.stop();this.recognition=null}this.dictating=''},searchCatalog(){this.run('Buscando productos del catálogo…',async()=>{const result=await this.api({action:'product_search',query:this.imageQuery});this.products=result.products;if(!this.products.length)this.success='No se encontraron productos en el catálogo.'})},selectProduct(product){this.selectedProduct=product;this.imageQuery=product.Producto;this.imageModel=product.ProductoModelo||'';this.draft.equipment=product.Producto;this.draft.model=product.ProductoModelo||'';this.success='Producto vinculado. Sus datos se copiaron al equipo del caso.'},searchImages(){this.run('Investigando imágenes y características del modelo…',async()=>{const result=await this.api({action:'images',query:this.imageQuery,model:this.imageModel});this.imageText=result.text;this.imageResults=result.images;this.imageSearched=true})},openProduct(image=''){if(!this.selectedProduct)return;this.$root.$emit('ali:product-info',Object.assign({},this.selectedProduct,{referenceImage:image}))}}}
</script>
<style>
.expert-workspace{min-height:100vh;padding:24px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#eef3fc,#f5faf9);color:#253b58;font:15px/1.6 'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif}.expert-hero{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(115deg,#213c73,#5b4bab);border-radius:18px;color:white;padding:26px 30px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px #293d7020}.expert-eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.7px;font-weight:700;color:#c1d8ff}.expert-hero h1{font-size:30px;margin:5px 0}.expert-hero p{margin:0 0 10px;color:#e0e8ff}.expert-workspace button{padding:11px 16px;min-height:44px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #cbd8eb;background:white;color:#344f79;font:600 14px 'Segoe UI',Arial;cursor:pointer}.expert-workspace button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}.expert-workspace .expert-primary{background:#5546b2;border-color:#5546b2;color:white}.expert-hero .expert-primary{background:#18a58a;border-color:#18a58a}.expert-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.expert-tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:7px;background:#e6ecf6;border:1px solid #d1dbec;border-radius:13px;margin:20px 0;overflow-x:auto}.expert-tabs button{white-space:nowrap;background:transparent;border-color:transparent;flex:1}.expert-tabs button.active{background:white;border-color:#d5dff0;color:#4a3e9d;box-shadow:0 3px 9px #30426312}.expert-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(0,.85fr);gap:18px;align-items:start}.expert-column{display:grid;gap:18px;min-width:0}.expert-card{min-width:0;background:white;border:1px solid #dce5f2;border-radius:16px;padding:22px;box-shadow:0 7px 20px #233a5c06}.expert-card h2{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 14px;color:#233b64}.expert-card p{margin:8px 0 15px}.expert-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.expert-workspace label{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 15px;min-width:0}.expert-workspace input:not([type=checkbox]),.expert-workspace textarea,.expert-workspace select{display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;padding:12px 13px;border:1px solid #cbd8eb;border-radius:10px;background:#fbfcff;color:#253b58;font:15px/1.5 'Segoe UI',Arial;margin-top:6px;box-sizing:border-box}.expert-workspace textarea{resize:vertical}.expert-workspace input:focus,.expert-workspace textarea:focus,.expert-workspace select:focus{outline:2px solid #acb9ef;outline-offset:1px}.expert-field-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px}.expert-field-heading small{font-weight:400}.expert-workspace .expert-voice{font-size:12px;padding:6px 10px;min-height:34px;flex-shrink:0}.expert-workspace small{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.expert-note{background:#eff4fc;color:#556e92;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px}.expert-error{background:#fff0f0;color:#9b3340;border:1px solid #f1c9ce;padding:13px;border-radius:10px}.expert-success{background:#eaf7f1;color:#28644f;border:1px solid #c6e8da;padding:13px;border-radius:10px}.expert-progress{background:#edf0ff;color:#4b4b93;padding:13px;border-radius:10px}.expert-output{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8}.expert-run{background:linear-gradient(130deg,#f4f3ff,#f7faff)}.expert-run>.expert-primary{width:100%;margin:10px 0}.expert-files,.expert-product-list,.expert-history{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:12px 0}.expert-files li,.expert-product-list li,.expert-history li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e8f3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.expert-files span,.expert-history li>div{min-width:0}.expert-files small,.expert-product-list small{display:block;color:#697d99}.expert-history p{font-size:13px;margin:3px 0}.expert-product-list button,.expert-history button{flex-shrink:0}.expert-report-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start}.expert-report-section{margin:14px 0}.expert-report-section label{margin:0;font-size:16px}.expert-review{display:flex!important;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:15px;background:#eff6f4;border:1px solid #c7e1d6;border-radius:10px;margin-top:20px!important}.expert-review input{margin-top:5px;flex-shrink:0}.expert-selected-product{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:15px 0;padding:14px;background:#eef7f5;border:1px solid #c3e2d9;border-radius:10px}.expert-image-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:18px}.expert-image-grid article{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #d6e1ef;border-radius:12px;min-width:0}.expert-image-grid img{width:100%;height:160px;object-fit:contain;background:#f4f7fb}.expert-image-grid a{font-size:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.expert-image-grid button{margin-top:auto}.expert-workspace a{color:#355cab;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.expert-workspace details summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}.expert-workspace details li{overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:1000px){.expert-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.expert-hero{align-items:flex-start}.expert-hero h1{font-size:26px}}@media(max-width:600px){.expert-workspace{padding:12px;font-size:14px}.expert-hero{padding:20px;flex-direction:column;border-radius:14px}.expert-hero h1{font-size:25px}.expert-hero .expert-actions{width:100%}.expert-hero button{flex:1}.expert-tabs{margin:14px 0}.expert-tabs button{font-size:13px;padding:10px 12px}.expert-card{padding:16px;border-radius:13px}.expert-fields{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}.expert-field-heading{align-items:flex-start}.expert-report-heading,.expert-selected-product{flex-direction:column}.expert-report-heading>button{width:100%}.expert-image-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}.expert-image-grid article{padding:8px}.expert-image-grid img{height:110px}.expert-image-grid button{font-size:12px;padding:9px}.expert-history li,.expert-product-list li{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.expert-history li>button